<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap');
        body {
            font-family: 'Outfit', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f4f8;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #2d3748;
        }
        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            table-layout: fixed;
            background-color: #f0f4f8;
            padding-bottom: 60px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4A90E2 0%, #357ABD 100%);
            padding: 50px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .header p {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            margin: 10px 0 0;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .user-intro {
            padding: 40px 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }
        .profile-image {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 4px solid #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            margin-top: -80px;
            background-color: #eee;
            object-fit: cover;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 0 40px 40px;
        }
        .content h2 {
            color: #2d3748;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .order-summary {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #edf2f7;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .order-meta {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;
        }
        .status-pill {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .pill-sent { background-color: #ebfbee; color: #2f855a; }
        .pill-cancelled { background-color: #fff5f5; color: #c53030; }
        
        .product-list { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        .product-row td { padding: 15px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f7fafc; }
        .product-row:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
        .product-img { width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 8px; object-fit: cover; background: #f7fafc; margin-right: 15px; }
        .product-info { font-weight: 600; color: #2d3748; }
        .product-price { text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #4A90E2; }
        
        .total-section {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 2px solid #edf2f7;
        }
        .total-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 14px; }
        .total-final { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 15px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #2d3748; }

        .footer {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #718096;
            border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <h1>MindBloom</h1>
                <p>Merci pour votre confiance</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="user-intro">
                {% if user_image_exists %}
                    <img src="cid:user_profile" class="profile-image">
                {% else %}
                    <div class="profile-image" style="display:inline-block; line-height:80px; color:#cbd5e0; font-weight:700;">{{ facture.user ? facture.user.fullName|first|upper : '?' }}</div>
                {% endif %}
                <h3 style="margin: 15px 0 5px;">Bonjour {{ facture.user ? facture.user.fullName|split(' ')|first : 'Client' }},</h3>
                <p style="margin: 0; color:#718096;">Nous avons du nouveau concernant votre commande.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="content">
                <div class="order-summary">
                    <div style="display:flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 25px;">
                        <div>
                            <span style="font-size: 12px; color: #a0aec0; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700;">Commande</span><br>
                            <span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px;">#{{ facture.id }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            {% if status == 'ENVOYE' %}
                                <span class="status-pill pill-sent">Expédiée</span>
                            {% else %}
                                <span class="status-pill pill-cancelled">Annulée</span>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    {% if status == 'ENVOYE' %}
                        <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 25px;">Excellente nouvelle ! Votre commande vient d'être remise à notre transporteur. Vous trouverez ci-dessous le récapitulatif ainsi que votre facture PDF en pièce jointe.</p>
                        
                        <table class="product-list">
                            {% for cmd in facture.commandes %}
                                <tr class="product-row">
                                    <td style="width: 65px;">
                                        {% if product_images[cmd.produit.id] is defined %}
                                            <img src="cid:product_{{ cmd.produit.id }}" class="product-img">
                                        {% else %}
                                            <div class="product-img"></div>
                                        {% endif %}
                                    </td>
                                    <td>
                                        <div class="product-info">{{ cmd.produit.nom }}</div>
                                        <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #a0aec0;">Quantité: {{ cmd.quantite }}</div>
                                    </td>
                                    <td class="product-price">
                                        {{ (cmd.produit.prix * cmd.quantite)|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} DT
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </table>

                        <div class="total-section">
                            <div class="total-final">
                                <span>Total TTC</span>
                                <span>{{ facture.montantTotal|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} DT</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    {% else %}
                        <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #e53e3e;">Nous avons le regret de vous informer que votre commande a été annulée. Si un paiement a été effectué, il vous sera remboursé dans les plus brefs délais.</p>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
                
                <p style="text-align: center; color: #718096; font-size: 14px;">Besoin d'aide ? Répondez simplement à cet email.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer">
                <p style="font-weight: 700; color: #2d3748; margin-bottom: 10px;">MindBloom — Votre bien-être au naturel</p>
                <p style="margin: 0;">Avenue de l'indépendance, Tunis</p>
                <p style="margin: 5px 0 0;">&copy; {{ 'now'|date('Y') }} MindBloom Platform</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
